#### [Permission Events](#permission-events)

-   `permission.asked`
-   `permission.replied`

#### [Server Events](#server-events)

-   `server.connected`

#### [Session Events](#session-events)

-   `session.created`
-   `session.compacted`
-   `session.deleted`
-   `session.diff`
